# Frontend (Vite) has no required build-time env vars - the dev server proxies
# /api to http://localhost:8080 (see vite.config.ts), and the Docker image's
# nginx.conf proxies /api to the "backend" service on the compose network.
#
# Backend configuration lives in backend/src/main/resources/application.yml
# and is overridden via the environment variables below (see docker-compose.yml
# for the full list used when running the whole stack):
#
# JWT_SECRET=change-this-in-production
# DB_PASSWORD=DevSecure2026!
# CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://localhost:5173
